			"Message": "style(Rest): Normalize shell script whitespace and alignment\n\nStandardize whitespace across Rest build and utility scripts: remove spaces before pipe operators in `Bench.sh` command chains, normalize redirection spacing (e.g. `2>/dev/null`, `>\"file\"`), and remove leading indentation before `case` pattern branches in `prepublishOnly.sh` so patterns align flush-left under `case`.\n\nThese are cosmetic-only changes with no functional impact.",
			"SHA": "635a8489f3cd0e230173ee5263166c2497fb9894"
		},
