			],
			"Message": "build(Rest): Update bundled binary artifact\n\nRefresh the `bin/Rest` executable to align with the latest compiled state from the Rust/OXC bundler build pipeline. This update incorporates recent refactoring and formatting changes applied to the Rest component's source code.\n\nThe binary is regenerated to ensure the sidecar can correctly bundle VS Code platform code for the Cocoon extension host.",
			"SHA": "e0b885921b810b2dd935c1c7369d01a9189bf375"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
