			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				100,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Rest): Expand build script lint allowances for transitional state\n\nAdd broad lint suppressions (`non_snake_case`, `dead_code`, `unused_variables`, etc.) to `build.rs` to accommodate the transitional phase of the Rest bundler's strict naming policy adoption.\n\nThese allowances ensure the build script compiles without warnings while upstream dependencies and internal structures are being refactored to full PascalCase compliance, preventing build noise during the migration.",
			"SHA": "8f445120ab754cb7fe562196dbbf1a6eebc6c114"
		}
